Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.28,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Closed Captioning by Red Bee Media
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.68,0:00:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.86,0:01:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:16.47,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.47,0:01:21.56,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.18,0:01:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We waited for Oikawa to show\Nup at Highton View Terrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.16,0:01:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He told us he was going\Nto the digital world,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.16,0:01:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we figured the sealed gate\Nwould fail and we could capture him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.06,0:01:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.14,0:01:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We followed Oikawa into a\Nstrange dimension where we
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,found out Myotismon had been\Ncontrolling him for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.54,0:01:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myotismon digivolved to Malo Myotismon\Nand destroyed our Okanimon and Mamemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, all we could think about was\Nwhat he could do to our Digimon friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.32,0:01:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone but Davis, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.04,0:01:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He and XVmon have gone\Nafter Malo Myotismon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.78,0:01:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I've been\Ngiving Davis enough credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.62,0:02:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the bravest person I know.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.14,0:02:10.06,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(275,0)\fscx115\fscy115\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(322,322)}The Last Armor Evolution
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.66,0:02:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too powerful, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.30,0:02:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here before he\Nturns X-V-Mon into a handbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.30,0:02:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'll never retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.10,0:02:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not as long as there's a fighting chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.16,0:02:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never quit before and\NI'm not gonna start now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.62,0:02:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as X-V-Mon is willing\Nto fight, I'm backing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.56,0:02:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never give up, Divus!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.38,0:02:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.40,0:02:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.70,0:02:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,X Laser!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.48,0:02:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you want to play hardball, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.00,0:02:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.18,0:02:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, X-V-Mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.54,0:02:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make him shut that ugly mouth of his!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.62,0:02:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be laser!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.22,0:02:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mental Illusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mom, sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.70,0:03:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.61,0:03:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.56,0:03:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just in time for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.76,0:03:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom made your favorite goulash. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.36,0:03:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's been a long time since\Nthe whole family's been together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.88,0:03:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.46,0:03:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be two dozen\Ndifferent desserts here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.26,0:03:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they all for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.22,0:03:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all for me! Yay!\NYay! Yay! All for me! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.64,0:03:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, this is the digital\Nworld I told you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.38,0:03:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can be pretty strange at\Nfirst, but you get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.60,0:03:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.72,0:03:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd really like to introduce\Nyou to some of the Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.32,0:03:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They may look small, but\Nthey're pretty powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.30,0:03:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have seen some of the\Ncrazy stuff we've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.02,0:03:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you'd be proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.10,0:04:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.44,0:04:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't it beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.78,0:04:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.20,0:04:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wondering if you\Ncould tell me when I
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.14,0:04:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can expect Nyaromon to\NDigivolve to Salamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.92,0:04:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you take good care of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.84,0:04:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, as long as you're\Ngiving her lots of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.12,0:04:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she'll Digivolve soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.82,0:04:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I heard a joke today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.46,0:04:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A duck walks into a pharmacy and\Nasks the clerk for some lip balm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.48,0:04:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pharmacist says, cash or charge, and\Nthe duck says, just put it on my bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.20,0:04:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.K.?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.24,0:04:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Patamon, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.08,0:04:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came to get you. We need you. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.20,0:04:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not finished eating dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.18,0:04:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of this is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.44,0:04:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.58,0:04:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Patamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, my family's finally all together.\NHuh? Wait a minute. What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.42,0:04:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.33,0:04:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon, do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.52,0:04:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want them to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.06,0:04:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.32,0:04:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.34,0:04:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They weren't here at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.34,0:05:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Melo, my Myotismon, you're going to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.80,0:05:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are, dude. Davis?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.54,0:05:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So are you ready to help me? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.20,0:05:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.52,0:05:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I'm going to get a\Nstomachache, and I don't even care.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.56,0:05:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.80,0:05:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My dear, is this really\Nwhat you've always wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.82,0:05:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.02,0:05:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dessert is my favorite meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.14,0:05:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you like not having your\Nbrothers and sisters around?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.30,0:05:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it means more for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.26,0:05:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I kind of miss them right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're always surrounded by\Nyour brothers and sisters,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.08,0:05:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you feel like you get passed over,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.72,0:05:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you've wondered what it would\Nbe like if they weren't around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.12,0:05:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.78,0:05:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.74,0:05:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I've always wondered what it\Nwould be like to be an only child.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I love my brothers and sisters,\Nand I love having them in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.14,0:05:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Hawkmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.05,0:05:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I was peeing a\Nreally big oinker back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.82,0:05:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes it takes someone to show\Nyou things a little more clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.90,0:05:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the greatest friend ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're making my feathers blush.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, we can really use your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's how we defeated Daemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.42,0:06:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon! I've been\Nlooking all over for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.36,0:06:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to meet my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.26,0:06:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.17,0:06:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.09,0:06:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.10,0:06:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon, I think I know my\Nown father when I see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.02,0:06:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just being funny, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.41,0:06:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Dad! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.08,0:06:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody, this is an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.38,0:06:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He left again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.28,0:06:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never got to share the\Ndigital world with my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.54,0:06:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't make that mistake again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.46,0:06:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share this world with my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.48,0:06:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope she can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.88,0:06:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say about that, Armadimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.08,0:06:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say it sounds like a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.82,0:07:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fladramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.90,0:07:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's waiting for us, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.04,0:07:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.28,0:07:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this just wonderful, Tailmon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humans and Digimon playing together without\Nsome lunatic trying to destroy it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.62,0:07:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.68,0:07:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.24,0:07:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to break it to you, but this\Nisn't the way things really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.94,0:07:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.85,0:07:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.77,0:07:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you been into the catnip again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.46,0:07:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all a big illusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean none of this is real?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.94,0:07:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What nerve?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.42,0:07:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, Omon, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.06,0:07:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.44,0:07:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.54,0:07:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Kari, we need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.86,0:07:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,MetalGreymon cast a spell over all\Nof the Digidestined to distract you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.42,0:07:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I know his tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.26,0:08:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then we wouldn't put up a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.48,0:08:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's always been lazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.10,0:08:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why he needed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.46,0:08:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But those days are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.68,0:08:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm with you now, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.48,0:08:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.46,0:08:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm with you now, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.20,0:08:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I got sand in my brain! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.14,0:08:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, there's something up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.90,0:08:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope it's a water fountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.90,0:08:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.56,0:08:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a person up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.50,0:08:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's... it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.84,0:08:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a Digimon Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.36,0:08:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's me there's no way\Nit doesn't make any sense
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.78,0:09:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's going on? We've come\Nto get some payback. Yeah, for
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.80,0:09:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all the pain and suffering it\Ncaused digimon throughout the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.78,0:09:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,digital world now it's our turn\Nmaybe you'll understand how
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.52,0:09:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,helpless we felt when you were the\Ndigimon emperor take this Get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.82,0:09:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.38,0:09:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.18,0:09:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.02,0:09:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, Sam, I thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.78,0:09:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've come back to invite\Nyou to stay with me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.06,0:09:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where you no longer have to suffer\Nfor the errors of your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.24,0:10:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your punishment is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.60,0:10:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.54,0:10:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.45,0:10:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get these visions out of my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.20,0:10:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I stay, will you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.42,0:10:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.06,0:10:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've missed you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.44,0:10:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.84,0:10:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.75,0:10:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormon, what happened to Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.90,0:10:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was never really here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.34,0:10:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he promised to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.92,0:10:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't change your past, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.52,0:10:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can only change your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.54,0:10:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brother was an illusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.26,0:10:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Malomyotismon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.62,0:10:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.82,0:10:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of beating myself up\Nfor what happened in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.32,0:10:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not the Digimon Emperor anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.20,0:10:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've paid for my mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.38,0:10:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that and so do all of my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.80,0:10:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare he use my brother against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.76,0:10:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a tool for darkness anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.22,0:10:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Melo Maiorisman can't change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.80,0:10:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.56,0:10:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got your back, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.16,0:10:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, TK, we're your friends, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.16,0:10:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can count on us no\Nmatter how bad it gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.34,0:10:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis is right, Ken, we're a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.32,0:10:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.44,0:11:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When one of us falls down, another\None of us picks them right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.60,0:11:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the way it's supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.04,0:11:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a two-way street, Ken. Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.04,0:11:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're your friends and we need\Nyou as much as you need us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.86,0:11:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without your experience, I\Ndon't know where we'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.28,0:11:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's right, Ken. Cody!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.92,0:11:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.30,0:11:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to believe it for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.12,0:11:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.12,0:11:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've waited a long time to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, handsome!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.86,0:11:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like your little\Nmagic trick didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.08,0:11:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.86,0:11:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take him, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.04,0:11:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire rocket, wonder flash, and fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.06,0:11:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They really hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.18,0:11:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how did Xvmon split into\Nhis three digivolutions?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.20,0:11:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.24,0:11:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even for this crazy place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.98,0:11:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was really weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.22,0:11:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wishing that Xvmon could get\Nstronger, and it just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.18,0:11:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.44,0:11:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Malomyotismon was making my blood boil.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.10,0:11:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I wished Xvmon was\Nstrong enough to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:11:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then there was three of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.62,0:12:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.76,0:12:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow in this weird dimension,\Nemotions become a reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.58,0:12:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis must have tapped into something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.24,0:12:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready, Patamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.58,0:12:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.66,0:12:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want the powers of\Ndarkness to hurt any of my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.44,0:12:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon! Armor Digiball 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.34,0:12:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon Digiball 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.18,0:12:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon Digivolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.50,0:12:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pegasmon! Galloping Hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.00,0:12:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magna Angemon! Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.50,0:12:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.41,0:12:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End of fate! Earth! Star shower!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.16,0:12:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, are you ready for\Nsome action? Indubitably!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.96,0:12:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are strong! We are strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.66,0:12:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pokémon Armored Digivolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.24,0:12:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pokémon Digivolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.78,0:12:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pokémon Armored Digivolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.24,0:13:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon, Samurai of Sincerity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.78,0:13:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aquilamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.20,0:13:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holsmon, the Wings of Love.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.24,0:13:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grand Horn. Tempest Wing. Double Stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.38,0:13:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready to join the party?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.16,0:13:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.36,0:13:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want Mallow Myotismon to be stopped\Nbefore he can hurt any more Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.20,0:13:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.14,0:13:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor Digibomb 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.26,0:13:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.22,0:13:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digibomb 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.06,0:13:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.98,0:13:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armored Digibomb 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.98,0:13:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Submarimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.94,0:13:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reliable Guardian of the Seas!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.66,0:13:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ankylomon! Digmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.38,0:13:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Drill Nop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.96,0:13:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold Rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.40,0:13:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,OXYGEN TORPEDO!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.58,0:14:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.88,0:14:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.22,0:14:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The future of both worlds depends on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.56,0:14:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Malomyotismon must be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.00,0:14:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon, Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.88,0:14:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon Armored Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.54,0:14:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon, the angel of light. Angemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.84,0:14:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rosanna Stone, celestial arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready, pal?\NI'm ready. Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.76,0:14:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormmon, Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.64,0:14:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.24,0:14:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't strike you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.40,0:15:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you've tapped into\Nthis dimension's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.24,0:15:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I underestimated you insects.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But did you think your\Nridiculous digi-rats can hurt me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.20,0:15:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you were wrong, and\Nnow it's my turn, kiddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.82,0:15:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crimson Mist!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.80,0:15:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.71,0:15:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.22,0:15:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.26,0:15:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.90,0:15:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA Digimon to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.80,0:15:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shakkoumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.38,0:15:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get him, Shakkoumon! What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.00,0:15:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.46,0:15:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.37,0:15:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.00,0:15:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.26,0:15:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.00,0:15:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silphymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.00,0:16:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a stunning force!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.26,0:16:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Zengmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.44,0:16:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seadramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.22,0:16:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.26,0:16:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.20,0:16:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Airdramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.88,0:16:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desperado Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.20,0:16:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got him on the ropes,\Nlet's finish this guy off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.02,0:16:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myildramon, Mega Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.04,0:16:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imperial Dramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.62,0:16:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over, Malomyotismon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.58,0:16:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imperial Dramon, no change to...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.94,0:16:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon, Digimon\Nare the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.28,0:17:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighter mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.80,0:17:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.36,0:17:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look around you, you're unmatched.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.80,0:17:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every Digimon here wants a piece of\Nyou, and I doubt you can fight them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.80,0:17:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suggest you surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.28,0:17:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see it, but I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.20,0:17:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This totally defies every\Nsingle law of science.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.78,0:17:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.69,0:17:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but somehow Dave is refusing to give\Nup even when Malomyotismon had us
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.66,0:17:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be created some kind of force that\Nmade all this crazy stuff possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to admit it, Davis really rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.38,0:17:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never would have\Nthought his bullheadedness
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.04,0:17:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would stand between me\Nand Never Never Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.18,0:17:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.12,0:17:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must admit I'm impressed\Nwith your tenacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.56,0:17:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait till you see my bullheadedness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.50,0:17:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm curious to know why my mind\Nillusion was ineffective against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.40,0:17:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can it be that you have no insecurities\Nor unhappiness for a defeat off of?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I have to worry about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.48,0:17:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got my friends,\Nmy family, the Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.82,0:17:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, some guy with a letter\Nopener on his face trying to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.42,0:17:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to say I\Ndon't have any problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.00,0:17:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.91,0:17:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not a single\Nchild in the world that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.26,0:17:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't have something\Nthey're worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.32,0:17:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you just met one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, big and ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.82,0:18:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you should go\Nback to your magic act.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.00,0:18:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if we're through chit-chatting,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.74,0:18:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to get back to the\Npart where we put you away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.50,0:18:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of monsters like you always\Ntrying to take over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.14,0:18:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.06,0:18:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna let you\Nhurt any more people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.84,0:18:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, you guys, let him have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.68,0:18:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ozzatron laser!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.98,0:18:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Double Positron Laser!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.90,0:18:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a shot! Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.32,0:18:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.76,0:18:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He went right through the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.30,0:18:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought he'd go through\Na two-walls with that shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.46,0:18:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, where are we, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.42,0:18:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like we're all\Nback in the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.04,0:18:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the other Digimon disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.98,0:18:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's back to normal, if\Nyou call this normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.90,0:18:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Myotismon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.28,0:19:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Children, were you looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.58,0:19:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for sending me into the\Ndigital world where I am most powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.68,0:19:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You foolish children played\Nright into my hands. Oh, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.58,0:19:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, he's getting bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.68,0:19:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.12,0:19:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel it, it's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.74,0:19:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys, it's now or never!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.38,0:19:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch and learn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.00,0:19:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.98,0:19:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops, I think I broke your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.06,0:20:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame they won't be conscious\Nto witness my most triumphant moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.10,0:20:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, behold my fellow man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.60,0:20:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He ripped open a hole\Nin the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.44,0:20:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like it leads\Nright to the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.94,0:20:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His power is starting to\Nspread over the entire planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.96,0:20:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.14,0:20:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been his plan all\Nalong to get both worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's remarkable how slow you are, Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.38,0:20:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you think I could be satisfied\Nruling only the digital world?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.44,0:20:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With both realms shrouded\Nin the power of my darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.06,0:20:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will rule both human and Digimon alike,\Nand there will be no one to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.16,0:20:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not while I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.62,0:20:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we fought him three years\Nago, he said the exact same things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.68,0:20:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he hasn't\Nchanged at all since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he's a lot more\Npowerful, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.08,0:20:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's a lot crazier than the\Nlast time we all fought him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.24,0:20:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.20,0:20:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's got to be some\Nway to take this guy out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.28,0:21:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are billions of humans\Nand Digimon counting on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.18,0:21:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Davis, what can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.68,0:21:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The darkness is spreading so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.54,0:21:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll take a miracle to stop him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.70,0:21:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Corey's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.66,0:21:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But where can I find a miracle?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.01,0:21:31.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Asu e mukau kisha wa togireta reeru de
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.54,0:21:37.52,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Mou furikaeru bakari tomadou watashi
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.94,0:21:45.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Te to te tsunagi awase issho ni hashiru to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.02,0:21:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.68,0:21:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why can't you be able to\Nget the power of each other?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.54,0:21:52.75,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sou ookina chikara ga daseru no wa naze?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.12,0:22:03.13,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo tsuuji atteru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.14,0:21:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We always, always,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.20,0:22:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,always, always, always, always, always,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.13,0:22:09.61,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo doko demo tonde ikeru wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.12,0:22:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.14,0:22:17.06,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo minna ga soba ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.06,0:22:24.44,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kitto kitto dare demo hitori janai wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.12,0:22:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how I fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.12,0:22:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how I fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.64,0:22:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how I fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.80,0:22:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how I fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.12,0:22:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the real war?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.70,0:22:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the end of the war?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.90,0:22:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the end of the war?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.28,0:22:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon Adventure 02.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.24,0:22:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The final episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:22:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the digital world.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.18,0:23:00.19,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,0)\fscx125\fscy125\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(321,318)}Our Digital World
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.64,0:23:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, all gates are open.

